          "@type": "oa:TextQuoteSelector",
          "oa:exact": "The applicant's name is an integral part of her/his identity. Consequently, under 22 CFR 51.23(c), evidence of identity might be required in accordance with Department guidance to establish the name that best identifies the applicant"
