          "@type": "oa:TextQuoteSelector",
          "oa:exact": "If the applicant has had a material name change more than one year prior to applying on form DS-11 but has not updated her/his ID to reflect the material name change, you must suspend the application to request an acceptable ID in the new name."
        },
