 documentation was \\\"seen and returned,\\\" to the applicant with the information request letter (IRL)\",\"start\":2259},{\"end\":2206,\"field\":\"context:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aaa23cc4bc9758753066c6a970bc4e4d08f001f9fb228a7ab60b296a5ade86fdc:2109:2206:sha256-16e688700644dcf2ef2c3a728bf835d6d705ac0344f583a89e961468ba5baeab\",\"quote\":\"The applicant generally will need the name change documentation to change the name on her/his ID.\",\"start\":2109},{\"end\":2414,\"field\":\"concepts:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aaa23cc4bc9758753066c6a970bc4e4d08f001f9fb228a7ab60b296a5ade86fdc:2207:2414:sha256-1eb00a877c849b271f663c3765078e0ad5bc21a29e3f9df718f46975989eb4f0\",\"quote\":\"You must fully notate the name change documentation prior to returning the documentation, including that the documentation was \\\"seen and returned,\\\" to the applicant with the information request letter (IRL);\",\"start\":2207}],\"id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:revision:63cca420070cef7064bdd675ff11d904945bea6e9ebf13d72b8ba5e87557ea2b\",\"jurisdiction\":\"\",\"jurisdiction_quote\":\"\",\"kind\":\"requirement\",\"logic_text\":\"\",\"meaning_assertion_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:82acf3efad2c45a3e4757883814c1495af35c0bc874a5ca0238b85bea88759e9\",\"modality\":\"must\",\"modality_quote\":\"must\",\"object\":\"the name change documentation\",\"occurrence_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:occurrence:059d3b8c26071e68098f1cbec14eb1538bf9512f660fb71f2299cca95e98548e\",\"origin\":\"aiSuggested\",\"quote\":\"You must fully notate the name change documentation prior to returning the documentation, including that the documentation was \\\"seen and returned,\\\" to the applicant with the information request letter (IRL);\",\"references\":[\"IRL\"],\"relation\":\"none\",\"rule_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:rule:b90969a088daaaac1c3e03d43605bde4d146863356811d2e2354799c6817bf33\",\"scope_quotes\":[\"prior to returning the documentation, including that the documentation was \\\"seen and returned,\\\" to the applicant with the information request letter (IRL)\"],\"scope_text\":\"Prior to returning the documentation to the applicant with the information request letter (IRL).\",\"section_id\":\"fam-names-section-4\",\"start\":2207,\"summary\":\"You must fully notate the name change documentation, including that it was 'seen and returned,' prior to returning it to the applicant with the information request letter (IRL).\",\"target_ids\":[],\"typed_values\":[]}",
